  "sections": {
    "review": {
      "summary": "Read the owner's final directive in full (1,689 lines). Reconciled Phase A findings against the code at 2e2520f, the live database and GitHub: the service template exported locally only (AUD-01a); readiness accepted a completed game with any line and named no cause (AUD-01b); evaluate counted a week complete on any completed game and accepted MISSED weeks, as the original declaration allowed (AUD-01c); write_once had staging and atomic rename but no fsync, lock, archivedAt or recovery, and a crash after the rename would block the week until its cutoff (AUD-01d); week 12's capture labelled 19 unowned D/STs free agents while ESPN reported all 19 on waivers in the same snapshot, freeAgents held every unowned unit, empty teams were absent and claimable-only evaluation was skipped without free agents (PB-AUD-07). Host: WSL2 with linger on; the Windows wake task wakes the PC at 00:10 and 16:55 UTC daily and starts WSL; powershell.exe interop works from systemd services. Only waiver claims carry processed_at (52/52 executed).",
      "files": [
        "docs/research/dvp/M3-3_AUDIT_REMEDIATION_AND_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE_FINAL.md",
        "scripts/model/dvp_prospective.py",
        "infra/systemd/arbit-dvp-prospective.service.template"
      ]
    },
    "plan": {
      "summary": "1) Register every external finding (audit-findings.json, AUDIT_RECONCILIATION.md). 2) Before the week-12 kickoff: declare and push prospective amendment 1 with the completion gate (window.py) and tests. 3) archive.py (lock, fsync, atomic rename, archivedAt, recovery) with failure injection. 4) evidence.py (sanitized commitment, dedicated clone and branch, read-back, GitHub activity timestamp) and publications.jsonl; record week 12's prior push. 5) Per-game readiness states. 6) League capture v2 (one snapshot, every team, observed availability, contradictions, labelled fallback), decision-time captures, week-12 supplement, four evaluation kinds. 7) status.json, alerts (journal, alerts.jsonl, Windows notification), self-retiring timer bounded to the window. 8) Docs, OWN-077, ENG-067. 9) Merge, then install the timer from main and verify the chain.",
      "files": [
        "config/dvp/prospective-amendment-1.json",
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/window.py",
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/archive.py",
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/evidence.py"
      ]
    },
    "implementation": {
      "summary": "window.py (archive_state, label_state, window_state, game_readiness); archive.py (exclusive, commit, self_consistent, recover); evidence.py (commitment, publish, verify_remote, read_activity, external_timestamp); dvp_prospective.py: league_capture v2, statistics_revisions, run_forecast via archive.commit with archivedAt and cutoff check, recover_archive, sweep with lock, status.json, alerts, capture_pending, publish_pending, retire_if_done; commands publish, record-prior, supplement; evaluate through the gate with league_week (rosterOnly, unownedPool, claimablePool, claimableWithWaivers); export without league.json. league.py without_decision. Unit templates (UTC calendar bounded to 2027-01-15, EnvironmentFile for evidence settings) and installer (linger check, key creation, registration check). Live: record-prior week 12 verified (23:13:15Z); evidence branch commitment 959ff9e verified (03:46:49Z); week-12 supplement (13 OWNED, 19 WAIVERS); sweep OK (week 13 waiting on 16 games, week-12 decision-time capture).",
      "files": [
        "scripts/model/dvp_prospective.py",
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/league.py",
        "infra/systemd/install-dvp-prospective.sh",
        "infra/systemd/arbit-dvp-prospective.timer.template"
      ]
    },
    "validation": {
      "summary": "All seven checks pass (foundation, model-tests, point-in-time, ruff check, ruff format, mypy on arbit-model and six model scripts, pytest -q full suite). Model suite 255 passed, 2 skipped (real-artifact tests need the main machine's audit run). New tests: test_dvp_window.py 15 (completion gate cases the directive lists, readiness states, amendment hash), test_dvp_archive.py 12 (failure injection, killed processes, concurrency, quarantine, fsync), test_dvp_evidence.py 6 (local bare remote: publish, read back, idempotence, failed push retried, mismatch, activity timestamp, harness retry). Live, against main's archive: week-12 prior push verified (GitHub 23:13:15Z, bytes equal the ledger); evidence-branch commitment verified (03:46:49Z, before the 2026-11-26 01:00Z cutoff); supplement from week 12's snapshot; sweep OK in 6 s; alert shown on Windows from a systemd user service; database sessions refuse writes (ReadOnlySqlTransaction). Not yet verified: unattended publication with the deploy key (needs the owner's registration) and the timer's first scheduled run (after merge and install).",
      "files": [
        "libs/arbit-model/tests/test_dvp_window.py",
        "libs/arbit-model/tests/test_dvp_archive.py",
